# Cutlass

This repo is the desktop editor prototype only. The real desktop app will be Rust, eframe, and egui. The phone UI will be a separate React app later. Do not add a phone shell here.

The prototype is a picture of the editor. AI commands change a mock timeline. They do not render video.

Repo: private GitHub `cutlass-rewrite`, branch `prototype`. Do not make it public. Do not read or clone other Cutlass projects.

Read `docs/` before changing the editor. When a decision is made, update the matching file in `docs/` in the same change.
